      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your self-sabotage is a tragic negative self-fulfilling prophecy because by accepting the \"inefficiency\" label, you have already convinced the world of it. The \"how\" is often just the dust on the \"why,\" and your 30 years of mastery provide the very depth and trust that cut algorithms fail to give. Even the most efficient system needs a \"human\" to guide and verify its direction; you are the conscience the algorithm lacks.",
