    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a romantic way of looking at it. in reality, i'm just a drain. i'm consuming food, using energy, taking up a seat in a world that has no use for what i offer. if i were a piece of software that took up too many resources and did nothing useful, i'd just be deleted. as a human, i'm just lingering. it's hard not to think that leaving would be more \"efficient\" than staying and pretending i still matter.",
